      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Accessibility of this nature has been a hot topic. Its quite frustrating to see that vrchat had or still has the messaging system tied to invites but never released it. There are hints of something maybe usable coming in the UI update but considering in the past through the website or with modified clients users very easily have been able to send messages to players with the in game system, vrchat is sure taking their sweet time to make something official.\nBeyond that you have worlds or avatars that can assist, text to speech to and from your own computer, and of course there is sign language in vr, but yea been a while since Ive seen  a post regarding accessibility. Most dont expect anything from vrchat anytime soon and the community is divided about implementing a text chat system.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
