  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-22T23:07:54.522Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have a friend who is mute, she absolutely loves the game but she always feels lonley because she can't talk with anyone. Could it be possible to implement some sort of feature that can help her and other people like her? Something like an onscreen keyboard function that can be used with controllers and then the message is turned into text to speach or something like that? Or an ingame keyboard that can be used with controllers to private text chat between friends so she can type to me what she wants to say and then i can speak for her. Any solution that can help even a little would be amazing. I really think it would make all the users who can't talk verry happy.",
